{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Knot.KashaevWindowAssembly","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Knot.KashaevWindowAssembly","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Knot.KashaevWindowIndex"],"declarations":4,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Knot.FigureEightVolume.abs_sum_kashaevProd_window_sub_model_le","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Knot.FigureEightVolume.abs_sum_kashaevProd_window_sub_model_le","kind":"theorem","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Knot/KashaevWindowAssembly.lean#L71-L141","doc":"**The assembly.**  The Kashaev window sum against the Gaussian closed form,\nwith every error explicit. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Knot.FigureEightVolume.sum_window_model_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Knot.FigureEightVolume.sum_window_model_eq","kind":"theorem","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Knot/KashaevWindowAssembly.lean#L59-L69","doc":"**The model sum, reindexed.**  Both `∑ e^{T}` over the `ℕ`-window and\n`∑ e^{−an²+2Ln}` over the `ℤ`-window are the same number. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Knot.FigureEightVolume.cast_toNat_shift_sub","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Knot.FigureEightVolume.cast_toNat_shift_sub","kind":"theorem","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Knot/KashaevWindowAssembly.lean#L44-L57","doc":"Inside a symmetric window that does not run off the bottom of `ℕ`, the\nshifted index casts back to the offset.  Without `W ≤ k` this is false —\n`Int.toNat` clamps — which is exactly what `sum_Icc_shift_int` needs it for. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Knot.FigureEightVolume.gaussWindowErr","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Knot.FigureEightVolume.gaussWindowErr","kind":"def","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Knot/KashaevWindowAssembly.lean#L35-L42","doc":"The window error of `abs_sum_Icc_tilted_sub_le`, named. ","signatureChunk":0}]}